      <li><a href="#faq">FAQs</a></li>
    </ul>
  </nav>

  <h2 id="verdict">The verdict: plan higher study and add a lab or data skill</h2>

  <p>
    Prepare in stages and keep proof. Employers and clients look for evidence, not claims.
  </p>
  <p>
    Check what your target role actually asks for by reading notices, then practise that version of the skill.
  </p>
  <div class="table-wrap">
    <table class="paths-table paths-table--wide">
      <thead>
        <tr>
          <th>Type of graduate</th>
          <th>Our read</th>
          <th>Why</th>
        </tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr>
          <td data-label="Type of graduate"><strong>Higher study plus a data or lab skill</strong></td>
          <td data-label="Our read">Strong</td>
          <td data-label="Why">Roles ask for both.</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td data-label="Type of graduate"><strong>Public-data projects</strong></td>
          <td data-label="Our read">Strong</td>
          <td data-label="Why">They show skill without a lab.</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td data-label="Type of graduate"><strong>A lab visit before committing</strong></td>
          <td data-label="Our read">Good</td>
          <td data-label="Why">It tests fit.</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td data-label="Type of graduate"><strong>BSc only with no skill add-on</strong></td>
          <td data-label="Our read">Risky</td>
          <td data-label="Why">Direct roles are few.</td>
        </tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </div>

  <h2 id="evidence">What can be said with confidence, and what cannot</h2>

  <p>
    Read ten notices for genetics and bioinformatics roles and visit a lab.
  </p>
  <p>
    We could not confirm how every employer or client assesses this. Ask two people in your target field.
  </p>
  <p>
    See also <a href="/blog/career-options/life-sciences-and-biological-sciences-career-options/">life sciences and biological sciences careers</a> and <a href="/blog/career-options/bsc-biotechnology-career-options/">BSc biotechnology career options</a>.
  </p>
  <p class="note-line">
    We did not rely on statistics for this page. The notices, conversations and your projects are the evidence.
  </p>
  <div class="honest-take">
    <p class="honest-take__label">Honest take</p>
    <p>
      Practice is free. Use the 10% rule of thumb for any paid course, with 20% as a caution, as an illustration, not a real fee.
    </p>
  </div>

  <h2 id="routes">Seven routes, strongest growth first</h2>

  <div class="route-grid">
    <div class="route-card">
      <div class="route-card__top">
        <span class="route-card__n">01</span>
        <span class="chip chip--high">Scalable</span>
      </div>
      <h3>Bioinformatics and genomic data analysis</h3>
      <p class="route-card__why">Analyse sequence data.</p>
      <p class="route-row route-row--teal"><span>Who pays you</span>Labs and firms.</p>
      <p class="route-row route-row--violet"><span>What earns trust</span>A pipeline on public data.</p>
      <p class="route-row route-row--gold"><span>Watch out</span>Needs coding skill.</p>
      <p class="route-row route-row--teal"><span>How it grows</span>Move toward lead roles.</p>
    </div>
