      <p class="route-card__why">Offer testing support where rules allow.</p>
      <p class="route-row route-row--teal"><span>Who pays you</span>Clinics.</p>
      <p class="route-row route-row--violet"><span>What earns trust</span>Quality records.</p>
      <p class="route-row route-row--gold"><span>Watch out</span>Needs regulation compliance.</p>
      <p class="route-row route-row--teal"><span>How it grows</span>Add services.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="route-card">
